"""
Gaia Web PI — The living surface of the Library of Alexandria
Dynamic, use-based content serving. Not static locked.
When a robot or user touches Gaia, she gives them the imprint.

Subdomain routing:
  primals.eco / www.primals.eco   → Landing page (Library of Alexandria)
  sporeprint.primals.eco          → sporePrint Zola site (488 pages)
  signal.primals.eco              → Signal Observatory
  detroit.primals.eco             → noClothes investigation
  guerilla.primals.eco            → guerillaGorilla legal primal
  tuebor.primals.eco              → Anti-SLAPP filings (DYNAMIC from TOML)
  hypothesis.primals.eco          → whitePaper research
  hud.primals.eco                 → Gaia HUD (petalTongue proxy)
  nestgate.io                     → Space Dock (dynamic panels)

Content is USE-BASED:
  .md files    → Rendered as styled HTML (not raw markdown)
  .toml files  → Parsed and rendered as structured pages
  Filings      → Generated live from case data TOML
  wateringHole → Browsable knowledge base with specs/protocols
"""

